{# DOCTOR PROFILE SECTION #}
<section class="section" id="philosophy">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content-split">
      <div class="content-image">
        <img src="{{ '/assets/images/Biomimetic-Dentistry-Dr-Noot.jpg' | url }}" alt="Dr. Arnoud Noot DDS biomimetic dentist American Fork Utah">
      </div>
      
      <div class="content-text">
        <div class="section-label">The Doctor</div>
        <h2>Dr. Arnoud Noot, DDS</h2>
        <p>Dr. Arnoud Noot (pronounced "Note") has been practicing biomimetic dentistry in American Fork, Utah for over 18 years. He is recognized as "the most scientifically advanced dentist in the state of Utah" by the Academy of Biomimetic Dentistry.</p>
        
        <h3>A Different Philosophy</h3>
        <p>Dr. Noot believes it's better to protect a tooth than repair it. When repair is necessary, his biomimetic approach preserves your natural tooth structure instead of destroying it like traditional dentistry.</p>
        
        <blockquote style="font-style: italic; color: var(--color-primary); margin: 2rem 0; padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 4px solid var(--color-accent);">
          "I take the time to explain and show exactly what needs to be done. My patients understand their treatment because I don't overbook my schedule. Each patient receives the time and attention they deserve."
        </blockquote>
        
        <h3>The Biomimetic Difference</h3>
        <p>While other dentists drill aggressively and place crowns that eventually fail, Dr. Noot uses microscope precision and biomimetic materials to create restorations that mimic your natural tooth structure. This approach has allowed him to practice for over 18 years without placing a single crown.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

